e among other players; however there will be a map that you should work with your teammate to win! Also don't forget the old saying: &quot;Enemy of my enemy is my friend!&quot;<br><br><strong>Customizable Character:</strong> Isn't playing with same outfit again and again boring? You will be able to change your clothes and exhibit your sense of fashion to other players!<br><br><strong>Note:</strong> Local Multiplayer game mode is only possible with multiple controllers.",
